First Occurrence of Target in an Array

You are given an array of integers and a target value. Find the index of the first occurrence of the target value in the array.
If the target is not present in the array, return -1.

Example
Input:
      arr = [4, 2, 7, 2, 9, 2]
      target = 2
Output:
      1
=================================================================

arr = [4, 2, 7, 2, 9, 2]
target = 2

for i in range(len(arr)):

    if arr[i] == target:
        print(i)
        break
else:
    print(-1)
